        "markdown": "# Script Node Presentation\n\nMake scripts good nodes: recognizable at a glance, inspectable without reading source, configurable through an authored editor, and honest about their effects and companion-node requirements.\n\nThe first proofs are the Collection Window Controller and Workboard Reconciler.",
