        "nextAction": "Refresh the Script Capability Placement Smoke graph, place Surface and Controller, then verify Apply Size, Run, Previous, and Next from the Controller Summary.",
        "progressNote": "The bridge now transports the Script node's class binding, presentation metadata, and safe authored configuration instead of reducing it to a plain controller. Collection Window Controller has its own declaration-first class graph: Summary is the firing surface, Detail and Editor expose configuration, and Icon identifies the capability. A trusted runScript control delegates execution to the host runner while enforcing bridge execution and mutation grants. The kit now exports two meaningful entries: Collection Surface and Collection Window Controller.",
